{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campanion is an atmospheric puzzle game where you use your mouse or gamepad to point and shoot your camera, loaded with exotic photo filters to reveal secrets and clues in your environment. Explore your grandpa's abandoned home and talk to the robots he left behind, using your camera bot to solve puzzles and make progress. Each room will test your curiosity and ingenuity to unveil the clues left for you to find. Place Cammy on the ground to control him separately to reach otherwise inaccessible areas and fetch objects out of your reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;If you're still dreaming of adventure...&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>20 years ago, your grandpa, a world-renowned explorer, disappeared without a trace.\u00a0One\u00a0day, you mysteriously receive a letter from him, inviting you to his old mansion, where an\u00a0incredible adventure is said to await you. Curiosity and long-suppressed wanderlust gets\u00a0the better of you, as you get dragged into the mystery of what actually happened to your\u00a0grandpa those 20 odd years ago.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/extras/fadbea1bc48d27cf9f90005eb16199e6.poster.avif?t=1759224211\" width=615 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/extras/fadbea1bc48d27cf9f90005eb16199e6.webm?t=1759224211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Campanion</i>, you and your new robotic pet camera <i>Cammy</i> must explore your missing\u00a0grandpa\u2019s mansion by utilizing a peculiar set of camera filters that reveal hidden details in\u00a0your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thermal photos reveal hot cables in the walls, the UV filter reveal secret\u00a0notes and fingerprints, the X-ray mode reveals hidden mechanisms, and much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work your way through the mansion, there is always something hidden one layer\u00a0beyond what your eyes can see. Will you find it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize Peculiar Photo Filters to Uncover Clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/extras/e497bc44a92964e5dcd4542e0f51fbbe.avif?t=1759224211\" width=1500 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/extras/7b911d7df61500c457fa401335a23447.avif?t=1759224211\" width=1500 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/extras/5a5eaae78cd29604893f34be7f9894b8.avif?t=1759224211\" width=1500 height=637 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Could there be even more?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034760?t=1759224211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034760?t=1759224211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/014e041bbb92f20970cab7b57d77f2d5ffbac8ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759224211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034760/014e041bbb92f20970cab7b57d77f2d5ffbac8ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759224211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conte